{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Egg Shop Simulator</strong>\u00a0is a simulation game where you manage every aspect of a shop that sells collectible mystery eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.poster.avif?t=1766049876\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.webm?t=1766049876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.mp4?t=1766049876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Manage Your Shop</u></strong><br>You are in full control. Start with an empty space and build it out.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Stocking:</strong>\u00a0Order inventory using your in-store computer and physically place the eggs on your shelves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/c417b831a6432662d4b482906792ca4b.poster.avif?t=1766049876\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/c417b831a6432662d4b482906792ca4b.webm?t=1766049876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/c417b831a6432662d4b482906792ca4b.mp4?t=1766049876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Price Control:</strong>\u00a0Set the price for each type of egg and adjust based on supply and demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkout &amp; Operations:</strong>\u00a0Scan items, take cash and card payments, and keep your store clean to attract more customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansion:</strong>\u00a0Use your profits to expand your store's physical space, buy more shelving, and upgrade your point-of-sale system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/08e2020f84ade86e30f42b22166a4828.poster.avif?t=1766049876\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/08e2020f84ade86e30f42b22166a4828.webm?t=1766049876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/08e2020f84ade86e30f42b22166a4828.mp4?t=1766049876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/b1a2680a89e09fbbd46b6b8a16fea3b8.poster.avif?t=1766049876\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/b1a2680a89e09fbbd46b6b8a16fea3b8.webm?t=1766049876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/b1a2680a89e09fbbd46b6b8a16fea3b8.mp4?t=1766049876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Open Eggs, Find Figures</u></strong><br>The core of your business offers a strategic choice:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Sealed:</strong>\u00a0Sell mystery eggs directly to customers for a consistent, reliable income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open for Profit:</strong>\u00a0Open the eggs yourself. Inside are collectible action figures with different rarities (Common, Uncommon, Rare, Legendary). A rare figure is worth far more than the sealed egg.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Craft and Sell Dioramas</u></strong><br>Don't just sell loose figures. Maximize their value with the crafting system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themed Sets:</strong>\u00a0Collect figures that belong to the same theme, like &quot;Space,&quot; &quot;Fantasy,&quot; or &quot;Dinosaurs.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Dioramas:</strong>\u00a0Place a complete set of themed figures onto the corresponding diorama base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell for High Value:</strong>\u00a0A finished diorama is a premium product that sells for a significantly higher price than the sum of its parts. This is the key to making big money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Grow Your Business</u></strong><br>Start small and build your way up. Reinvest your earnings to unlock new series of mystery eggs, each with it\u2019s own unique set of figures and dioramas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Shop Management:</strong>\u00a0Physically run your store, from stocking shelves to operating the cash register.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory and Price Management:</strong>\u00a0Order stock via a computer and set your own prices for all products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbox and Collect:</strong>\u00a0Open mystery eggs to find hundreds of different action figures across multiple themed sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figure Rarity System:</strong>\u00a0Figures range from common to legendary, directly impacting their value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diorama Crafting System:</strong>\u00a0Combine figures of the same theme on a diorama base to create high-value collector's items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Expansion and Upgrades:</strong>\u00a0Grow your store's physical size, improve your equipment, and customize its appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle &amp; Customer AI:</strong>\u00a0Manage your shop during open hours and prepare for the next day after closing.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850970?t=1766049876","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850970?t=1766049876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/c007d303ece75de9e9197a684725881d4fc42a20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766049876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/c007d303ece75de9e9197a684725881d4fc42a20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766049876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4129650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Egg Shop Simulator</strong>\u00a0is a simulation game where you manage every aspect of a shop that sells collectible mystery eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.poster.avif?t=1766049876\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=